lab-catalog-note-link = Implemented Link; native mouse, keyboard, disabled, focus, and local navigation checks passed. External navigation and screen-reader announcements remain unverified.
lab-catalog-note-button = Public RustUI Button story with a live count, Increment and Reset actions, and a disabled Unavailable state; native visual, keyboard, and accessibility acceptance remain pending.
lab-catalog-note-text = Standalone public RustUI Text specimen with heading, body, and wrapping samples; the framework Text story remains a catalog-message localization gallery with interpolation and plural/ordinal/select examples. Native visual, keyboard, and accessibility acceptance remains pending.
lab-catalog-note-label = Label text and secondary content implemented; icon asset registration pending.
lab-catalog-note-checkbox = RustUI baseline demo; interaction and visual acceptance pending.
lab-catalog-note-divider = Horizontal and vertical Divider implemented and visually checked.
lab-catalog-note-icon = Named icon wrapper implemented; runtime asset registration and visual acceptance pending.
lab-catalog-note-image = File and application-asset Image adapter implemented; local PNG visual check passed.
lab-catalog-note-slider = RustUI baseline demo; interaction and visual acceptance pending.
lab-catalog-note-toggle = RustUI baseline demo; interaction and visual acceptance pending.
lab-catalog-note-picker = RustUI baseline demo; interaction and visual acceptance pending.
lab-catalog-note-stepper = RustUI baseline demo; interaction and visual acceptance pending.
lab-catalog-note-scroll_view = RustUI baseline demo; interaction and visual acceptance pending.
lab-catalog-note-text_field = RustUI baseline demo; interaction and visual acceptance pending.
lab-catalog-note-search_field_examples = Routes to the shared Text inputs story, which renders six Search and Token Field examples plus all six Dark Search Field combinations (Disabled, Focused, and Idle with text absent or present). Coverage remains Partial pending native visual and accessibility acceptance.
lab-catalog-note-radio_button = RustUI baseline demo; interaction and visual acceptance pending.
lab-catalog-note-combo_box = RustUI baseline demo; interaction and visual acceptance pending.
lab-catalog-note-form_accessories = Public-API Form Accessories composition with a filter field and detail, info, and action controls; native visual and accessibility acceptance remain pending.
lab-catalog-note-alert_dialog = Inline Alert uses the GPUI Components adapter with owner-controlled visibility; native visual and accessibility acceptance pending.
lab-catalog-note-save_dialog = RustUI Dialog story demonstrates trigger, confirm, cancel, and visible action results; native GUI acceptance pending.
lab-catalog-note-menu = RustUI action menu using the upstream popup; M30 accepted keyboard/pointer actions and disabled callback suppression. Enter dismisses a disabled row; native row identity is positional. M31 native layout and child Button action (0 to 1) were observed; tooltip display and dismissal remain unverified because pointer-only hover dwell was unavailable. No tooltip failure is established. ContextMenu gallery is bundled on this route; native context-menu behavior and owner-removal acceptance remain pending.
lab-catalog-note-list = KeyedList gallery with 1,000 stable IDs, selected-row ID, and reverse, prepend, remove, and reset controls; native acceptance pending.
lab-catalog-note-notification = Public RustUI feedback gallery with action and kind-specific Toasts, EmptyState, ErrorState, and Skeleton examples; native visual and accessibility acceptance remain pending.
lab-catalog-note-window_chrome = Owner-state public RustUI VStack, HStack, Text, and Button composition; creating or closing a sample document updates its title and body. Illustrative only: no native titlebar or system-window action; dedicated adapter and native acceptance remain open.
lab-catalog-note-toolbar = Ordered Toolbar actions use the GPUI Components adapter; native interaction and accessibility acceptance pending.
lab-catalog-note-sidebar = Controlled flat Sidebar with stable item IDs, external selection, disabled Settings, reorder/relabel controls, and visible unmatched-selection policy; native focus and keyboard acceptance pending.
lab-catalog-note-text_style_guide = Public RustUI Text examples for reference sizes and regular/bold weights; the separate framework Text story contains the localization gallery. Native visual, keyboard, and accessibility acceptance remains pending.
lab-catalog-note-utility_window = Preview mirrors the Utility Panel title and its five named category tabs; native visual, keyboard, and accessibility acceptance remain pending.
lab-catalog-note-button_group = Public Button/HStack composition with three related actions; native visual, keyboard, and accessibility acceptance remain pending.
lab-catalog-note-color_picker = Public RustUI ColorPicker with a retained color binding in the shared Text inputs story alongside DatePicker and other controls; native visual, keyboard, and accessibility acceptance remain pending.
lab-catalog-note-disclosure_control = Controlled GPUI Components Collapsible with bound open state, disabled activation, stable identity, and unmounted collapsed content; native interaction, visual, and accessibility acceptance remain pending.
lab-catalog-note-form = Reuses the public Form Accessories composition with a filter field and detail, info, and action controls; native visual and accessibility acceptance remain pending.
lab-catalog-note-menu_bar = Six interactive RustUI Menu controls dispatch owner actions; Finder and date/time are labels. Native menu-bar chrome, icons, and visual/accessibility acceptance remain pending.
lab-catalog-note-menu_item = Routes to the public RustUI Menu gallery, which demonstrates MenuItem actions, separators, disabled-item handling, and removing/restoring the menu owner; native visual and accessibility acceptance remain pending.
lab-catalog-note-menu_separator = Menu separator is demonstrated in the existing menu action gallery; standalone native visual and accessibility acceptance pending.
lab-catalog-note-outline_view = Public RustUI Outline gallery with controlled stable-ID selection and branch expansion, collapse/expand-all, branch removal/restoration, reorder/relabel controls, and unmount/remount; native interaction and accessibility acceptance remain pending.
lab-catalog-note-search_field = RustUI baseline demo; interaction and visual acceptance pending.
lab-catalog-note-segmented_control = Finder view modes are represented by mutually exclusive public Button controls; RustUI has no dedicated Segmented Control renderer, and native visual/accessibility acceptance remains pending.
lab-catalog-note-tab_bar = Public RustUI TabView with Overview, Activity, and Settings; native visual, keyboard, and accessibility acceptance remain pending.
lab-catalog-note-table = Public RustUI Table story combines controlled row selection, reordering, removal/restoration, and a DataGrid accessibility example; native visual, keyboard, and accessibility acceptance remain pending.
lab-catalog-note-window_controls = Preview shows static Close/Minimize/Zoom labels. References show inactive translucent circles and active red/yellow/green traffic lights; RustUI has no public window-control/titlebar renderer.
lab-catalog-note-navigation_split = M137 canonical Playground pointer resize and destination switching passed; keyboard divider, full accessibility, locale, adaptive collapse, and cross-platform acceptance remain pending.
lab-catalog-note-offset = Signed relative positioning demo; native interaction and accessibility acceptance pending.
lab-catalog-note-collection = Virtualized stable-ID row demo; native interaction and lifecycle acceptance pending.
lab-catalog-note-sheet = Trigger-opened GPUI Components side sheet with optional title and body; native GUI acceptance pending.
lab-catalog-note-drag_drop = Typed same-process Copy and Transfer gallery; M142 verified keyboard alternatives and M148 verified target removal during a held drag on macOS.

